    <p>Titus is an ordinary, happy little lamb who loves God and loves the Shepherd's stories — and is <em>very</em> curious about the Bible. Every episode opens with a wondering question, straight from the satchel, and closes with a scripture hook so catchy your family will be humming it at bedtime.</p>
    <p>Titus has a home, a family, a bed, just like your kid — the Bible stories are told and imagined, the way a child would picture them, gentle and full of wonder.</p>
  </div>
</section>

